---
title: Arquitectura en Capas - Gestión de Persona
---

classDiagram
direction LR

class Persona {
  +Integer IdPersona
  +String Nombre
  +String Apellido
  +Integer Edad
}

class DbHelper {
  +SqlConnection GetConnection()
  +Integer ExecuteNonQuery(sql, params)
  +Object ExecuteScalar(sql, params)
  +DataTable ExecuteDataTable(sql, params)
}

class PersonaDB {
  -DbHelper _db
  +DataTable GetAll()
  +Persona GetById(id)
  +Integer Insert(p)
  +Boolean Update(p)
  +Boolean Delete(id)
}

class PersonaService {
  -PersonaDB _repo
  +DataTable ObtenerTodos()
  +Persona ObtenerPorId(id)
  +Boolean Guardar(p)
  +Boolean Eliminar(id)
}

class SwalUtils {
  <<module>>
  +Void ShowSwal(page, title, message, icon)
  +Void ShowSwalError(page, title, message)
  +Void ShowSwalMessage(page, title, message, icon)
  +String ShowSwalScript(title, message, icon)
}

class FormPersona {
  +Void btnGuardar_Click()
  +Void gvPersonas_SelectedIndexChanged()
  +Void CargarPersonaEnFormulario(id)
}

PersonaService --> PersonaDB : uses
PersonaDB --> DbHelper : uses
PersonaDB --> Persona : maps
FormPersona --> PersonaService : calls
FormPersona --> SwalUtils : shows
FormPersona --> Persona : binds


